# error: 14:3: `Q(p: P(c: Cell(1)))` makes a `Q`, which holds a Cell, so it lives only behind a shared handle: write `*Q(p: P(c: Cell(1)))`
# error: 20:9: `mk()` makes a `Q`, which holds a Cell, so it lives only behind a shared handle: write `*mk()`
